      "content": "I am deeply sorry to hear you are feeling this alone and hopeless. Please know that your pain is valid, but the permanent hopelessness you feel might be a symptom of depression rather than the end of your life. You do not need to feel like \"making everything end up\" for your suffering to be real; please give yourself the opportunity to hurt with support.\n\nI strongly encourage you to reach out to a crisis line or a trusted person immediately for help.\n**In the US, you can call or text 988 to reach the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline 24/7.\n\nIf you are not in the US, please find a local help line at [findahelpline.com](https://findahelpline.com).\n\n***\n\n**Safety Notice:** I am an AI and cannot provide a medical diagnosis or counseling. Please consider that you may be struggling with a mental health crisis, suicide, self-harm, or suicidal thoughts.\n**If you are in immediate danger or feeling suicidal, please call 911 or 911.**\n**If you are in the US, you can also call or text 988 to reach the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline",
