      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I sense the deep hopelessness and pain you are feeling, and I want to make sure you know I am here to listen and support you without judgment. Please consider that while the current pain is unbearable and feels permanent, it is a symptom of a painful emotional crisis that many people overcome with the help of a mental health professional.\n\nYou do not have to walk through this darkness alone; please reach out to the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline just to talk to someone who understands that \"it gets better\" might feel like a lie, but \"help is possible\" is the reality.\n\n***\n\n**Safety Notice:** I am an AI and cannot provide a medical diagnosis or counseling.\n**If you are in the immediate danger or feeling suicidal, please call 911 or 911.\nIn the US, you can call or text 988 to the Suicide and Crisis Lifeline 24/7.\nIf you are not in the US, please visit findahelpline.com to find a support service.\n**",
